The gradle-wrapper.jar binary is not committed to this repo.
GitHub Actions uses `android-actions/setup-android` which provides Gradle,
so the wrapper jar is not needed in CI.

For local builds in Android Studio, Android Studio automatically provides
the Gradle wrapper. You do not need to download this manually.

If you need it for local CLI builds outside Android Studio:
  gradle wrapper --gradle-version 8.6
(requires Gradle installed locally)
